            <note corresp="#d29-f4" n="4" xml:id="d29-f4-content">
                <p>McFarlane initialed the “Agree”
                    option.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f5" n="5" xml:id="d29-f5-content">
                <p>McFarlane initialed the “Agree”
                    option.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f6" n="6" xml:id="d29-f6-content">
                <p>DeGraffenreid wrote next to his concurrence, “Strongly agree with Walt that we
                    must <hi rendition="#italic">not</hi> let these programs be reduced.”</p>
            </note>
